===Etymology 1===
From {{inh|de|gmh|messer}}, {{m|gmh|mezzer}}, from {{inh|de|goh|mezzeres}}, {{m|goh|mezzirahs}}, {{m|goh|mezzisahs||knife}}, from {{inh|de|gem-pro|*matisahsą||knife used for cutting food}}, from {{m|gem-pro|*matiz||food}} + {{m|gem-pro|*sahsą||knife, dagger}}. Cognate with {{cog|osx|metisahs}}, {{m|osx|mezas||knife}}, {{cog|fy|mês}}, {{cog|nl|mes||knife}}, {{cog|ang|meteseax||knife}}. See also {{l|en|meat}}, {{l|en|sax}}.

